Inversa Panel brings the most used OPNsense settings onto a single, simple screen:
see every device on the network, cut a device's internet access with one
click, block ads, malware, adult content, gambling and apps via DNS, and
watch internet traffic and blocked requests on an overview page.

Inversa Panel does not keep a parallel configuration: it writes to OPNsense's own
firewall alias ("inversapanel_blocked"), automatic firewall rules and the Unbound
blocklist policy "Inversa Panel (managed)", so everything stays visible in the
regular OPNsense pages.
